 "description": "GetListCapTableStakeholders returns a company's stakeholder roster: identities only \u2014 name, type, email, title, address \u2014 and NO share counts or ownership percentages, which live on the securities. Paginated, read-only. To answer \"who owns what\", or anything needing a share count, call GetListCapTableSecurities; to report a total or a founder percentage, call GetCapTableSummary. Never state or derive a holding from this response: a roster read alone cannot tell you one, and a plausible split presented as fact on a cap table is worse than saying you do not have the numbers.",
